    {
      "source": "Supports loading from a properties file and/or setting local properties on this FactoryBean. The created Properties\ninstance will be merged from loaded and local values. If neither a location nor local properties are set, an\nexception will be thrown on initialization.",
      "translation": "支持从属性文件加载和/或在此 FactoryBean 上设置本地属性。创建的 Properties 实例将从加载的值和本地值中合并生成。如果未设置位置或本地属性，则在初始化时将抛出异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Can create a singleton or a new object on each request. Default is a singleton.",
      "translation": "可以创建单例对象或在每次请求时创建新对象。默认值为单例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default is true (a shared singleton).",
      "translation": "默认为 true（共享单例）。",
      "count": 1
    },
